{"nodes":[{"id":"61eba20dfe5938a4","type":"text","text":"[KB]\n{{[[chatgpt and financial management]]}}\n{{[[using code interpreter for financial projects]]}}\n{{[[what are some limitations of using chatgpt for financial reporting]]}}\n{{[[what are some examples of financial reports that chatgpt can generate]]}}\n{{[[what are some specific tasks that chatgpt can help with in financial management]]}}\n{{[[what are some examples of financial reports that chatgpt can generate]]}}\n{{[[ChatGPT Code Interpreter]]}}\n{{[[how could the chatgpt code interpreter be applied in financial management of a business]]}}\n{{[[ChatGPT Code Interpreter]]}}\n\nLearners will require a ChatGPT+ Account, with access to the advanced data analysis function.","x":-41,"y":-194,"width":721,"height":754},{"id":"6d4cb37e40c281eb","type":"text","text":"[audience]\nAdult learners looking to upskill or for a career change","x":-340,"y":-194,"width":250,"height":229},{"id":"b899d8fd05e60755","type":"text","text":"[Tone]\nProfessional, educational, engaging","x":-620,"y":-194,"width":250,"height":220},{"id":"7473cc1c6c72e117","type":"text","text":"{{[[Outline Expander]]}} act as an expert in {{[topic]}}. Expand ONLY {{[mod]}} from {{[summary]}} using {{[KB]}} as a knolwedge base for {{[audience]}} learn {{[skills]}} into no more than 8 subtopics.\n\nWe are continuing {{[course]}}, so be sure to create ONLY original content not yet included.\n","x":29,"y":1080,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"3"},{"id":"e206a944b2d106de","type":"text","text":"","x":-279,"y":1508,"width":997,"height":1292,"color":"6"},{"id":"e4ce0f2c27c7ebf7","type":"text","text":"[skills]\n\n1. **Strategic AI Integration Skills**: The ability to develop and implement strategies for incorporating AI technologies into existing financial systems and workflows. This includes understanding the technical requirements, potential challenges, and steps for successful integration.\n    \n2. **Analytical Skills**: Proficiency in analyzing the impact of Generative AI on strategic financial decision-making processes. This involves evaluating how AI can influence resource allocation, forecasting, budgeting, and other critical financial decisions.\n    \n3. **Innovative Thinking**: The capability to explore and identify how AI can shape future financial strategies and drive innovations within the company. This skill requires a forward-thinking approach, considering emerging AI trends and their potential applications in finance.\n    \n4. **Ethical Framework Design**: The ability to design and implement a framework for ethical decision-making in AI applications. This includes understanding and addressing issues related to accountability, fairness, transparency, and the potential for bias in AI-driven financial decisions.\n    \n5. **Critical Thinking**: Enhanced critical thinking skills to evaluate the benefits and limitations of AI in financial management, ensuring that strategic decisions are made based on a comprehensive understanding of AI capabilities and ethical considerations.\n    \n6. **Problem-Solving Skills**: The ability to identify and solve complex problems that may arise during the integration of AI into financial systems, including technical, ethical, and strategic challenges.\n    \n7. **Communication Skills**: Proficiency in communicating the strategic value of AI integration to stakeholders, including explaining complex AI concepts in understandable terms and articulating the benefits and potential risks of AI-driven financial strategies.\n    \n8. **Adaptability and Continuous Learning**: The skill to adapt to rapidly evolving AI technologies and their applications in finance, demonstrating a commitment to continuous learning and staying abreast of the latest developments in AI and financial management.\n\n","x":1000,"y":-264,"width":810,"height":1064},{"id":"fa8e408b339af0b3","type":"text","text":"\"\"{{intro}}\n\n{{1}}\n\n{{quiz1}}\n\n{{2}}\n\n{{quiz2}}\n\n{{3}}\n\n{{quiz3}}\n\n{{4}}\n\n{{quiz4}}\n\n{{5}}\n\n{{quiz5}}\n\n{{6}}\n\n{{quiz6}}\n\n{{7}}\n\n{{quiz7}}\n\n{{8}}\n\n{{quiz8}}\n\n{{project}}\"\"","x":1647,"y":11680,"width":250,"height":310,"color":"6"},{"id":"6b08fd22e19786b1","type":"text","text":"{{[[Project Creator]]}} create a project for {{outline}}","x":-5440,"y":1662,"width":250,"height":197,"color":"0"},{"id":"93f974dc493a921c","type":"text","text":"","x":-6155,"y":10318,"width":840,"height":1040,"color":"6"},{"id":"47f3fa50432c1c0c","type":"text","text":"","x":2565,"y":5250,"width":1110,"height":2489,"color":"6"},{"id":"16db1f58b349981e","type":"text","text":"","x":1730,"y":8820,"width":714,"height":840,"color":"6"},{"id":"942b2971771b8692","type":"text","text":"{{[[Knowledge Checker]]}} create no more than 3 knowledge checks for {{4}}, each with the correct answer identified, and an explanation.","x":1962,"y":8091,"width":250,"height":486,"color":"0"},{"id":"b69f87131bc3147d","type":"text","text":"","x":4358,"y":6075,"width":1110,"height":2430,"color":"6"},{"id":"dce5df780ab52cad","type":"text","text":"{{[[SubModule Author]]}} act as an expert in {{[topic]}}, and continue from {{3}} to write ONLY {{[mod]}}.4 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":2961,"y":4239,"width":319,"height":441,"color":"0"},{"id":"b71fc4b1670d8202","type":"text","text":"{{[[SubModule Author]]}} act as an expert in {{[topic]}}, and continue from {{4}} to write ONLY {{[mod]}}.5 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":4754,"y":4236,"width":319,"height":484,"color":"0"},{"id":"2df670b30b84da25","type":"text","text":"","x":3950,"y":9660,"width":714,"height":840,"color":"6"},{"id":"ddec3972db6f7243","type":"text","text":"{{[[Knowledge Checker]]}} create no more than 3 knowledge checks for {{5}}, each with the correct answer identified, and an explanation.","x":4823,"y":9126,"width":250,"height":486,"color":"0"},{"id":"ec281eb53ad2292c","type":"text