and write ONLY {{[mod]}}.1 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":-3054,"y":4236,"width":319,"height":324,"color":"0"},{"id":"ffeed93fa7b06953","type":"text","text":"{{[[Knowledge Checker]]}} create no more than 3 knowledge checks for {{2}}, each with the correct answer identified, and an explanation. ","x":-1489,"y":7867,"width":250,"height":486,"color":"0"},{"id":"1fbf9b21f78a8917","type":"text","text":"","x":-1239,"y":8535,"width":714,"height":840,"color":"6"},{"id":"254a29f8fa305f0d","type":"text","text":"","x":-1229,"y":5208,"width":1110,"height":2489,"color":"6"},{"id":"edd7a949f8bba0d1","type":"text","text":"{{[[SubModule Author]]}}, act as an expert in {{[topic]}}, and continue from {{1}} to write ONLY {{[mod]}}.2 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":-833,"y":4239,"width":319,"height":441,"color":"0"},{"id":"447f381cf6a3bec0","type":"text","text":"{{[[Knowledge Checker]]}} create no more than 3 knowledge checks for {{3}}, each with the correct answer identified, and an explanation.","x":499,"y":8040,"width":250,"height":486,"color":"0"},{"id":"dbd31cbb95820176","type":"text","text":"","x":499,"y":8769,"width":714,"height":840,"color":"6"},{"id":"9615582972b8676a","type":"text","text":"","x":620,"y":5199,"width":1110,"height":2489,"color":"6"},{"id":"473d4bbb63eb4647","type":"text","text":"{{[[SubModule Author]]}} act as an expert in {{[topic]}}, and continue from {{2}} to write ONLY {{[mod]}}.3 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":1016,"y":4239,"width":319,"height":401,"color":"0"},{"id":"385538c9f6e1c7bf","type":"text","text":"","x":1360,"y":12160,"width":800,"height":1240,"color":"6"},{"id":"cb0c5985b7580195","type":"text","text":"[course]","x":-340,"y":109,"width":250,"height":264},{"id":"fd15b5781ca74dcf","type":"text","text":"[mod]\nModule 1\n","x":-620,"y":109,"width":250,"height":127},{"id":"308aa6cf7f5c3b4d","type":"text","text":"","x":9294,"y":11613,"width":1110,"height":2844,"color":"6"},{"id":"7fb17253362602bd","type":"text","text":"{{[[Knowledge Checker]]}} create no more than 3 knowledge checks for {{7}}, each with the correct answer identified, and an explanation.","x":9599,"y":14834,"width":250,"height":486,"color":"0"},{"id":"fb4f9eabbe0185c4","type":"text","text":"","x":8129,"y":15077,"width":714,"height":840,"color":"6"},{"id":"362e9f66bf03a952","type":"text","text":"[summary]\n##### Module 1: AI in Data Analysis and Financial Reporting\n\n#### Learning Objectives:\n\n- Understand Generative AI's Role in Financial Data Analysis: Grasp how Generative AI like ChatGPT can enhance data collection and analysis.\n    \n- Use AI Tools for Insights and Analytics: Learn practical skills in leveraging Generative AI for generating insights and support the development of future predictions in finance for your company.\n    \n\n#### Content and Structure:\n\n- Introduction to Generative AI in Data Analysis:\n\n- Content: A comprehensive overview of the evolution of AI in financial data analysis. Begin with early applications of AI in finance and progress to current state-of-the-art technologies and trends distinguishing between classical AI and Generative AI.\n\n- Hands-on Training with ChatGPT Advanced Data Analysis:\n\n- Content: A step-by-step tutorial on using ChatGPT for financial data analysis, including uploading data, interpreting results, and troubleshooting common issues.\n\n- Financial Modeling:\n\n- Content: Exploration of how to use Generative AI for financial modeling, focusing on the different analyses to run, efficiency, accuracy, and predictive analyses to try.\n    \n- Fictional Case Study: Analyze an  example where generative AI was used to financially model something. Discuss both successes and challenges.\n\n- Creating Reports:\n\n- Content: Instruction on how to use Generative AI tools to generate financial reports, based on their analyses for different audiences emphasizing clarity, conciseness, and relevance.\n\n#### Assessment:\n\n- Task: Create a comprehensive financial report using an AI analytics tool on a provided dataset.\n    \n- Criteria: Evaluation based on accuracy of analysis, quality of insights, clarity of reporting, and overall presentation.\n    \n- Feedback Mechanism: Provide detailed feedback highlighting areas of strength and suggestions for improvement.","x":-1560,"y":-194,"width":540,"height":914},{"id":"b721d13b70d028de","type":"text","text":"[topic]\nGenerative AI, ChatGPT, Data Analysis with {{[[ChatGPT Code Interpreter]]}}, Financial Management at companies\n\nOMIT topics related specific to financial management related to banking, or investing. This is a broad course on managing finances within a company.","x":-960,"y":-194,"width":250,"height":457},{"id":"971d3f36f09c8940","type":"text","text":"{{[[SubModule Author]]}} act as an expert in {{[topic]}}, and continue from {{1}} to {{6}} write ONLY {{[mod]}}.7 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":7840,"y":4360,"width":319,"height":400,"color":"0"},{"id":"909f15933e2fc5a6","type":"text","text":"{{[[SubModule Author]]}} act as an expert in {{[topic]}}, and continue from {{8}} to write ONLY {{mod}}.8 of {{outline}} in {{[Tone]}} tone for {{[audience]}} audience using knowledge base {{[KB]}}. ","x":9560,"y":4440,"width":319,"height":440,"color":"0"},{"id":"25a3aa5d222e45a9","x":459,"y":1185,"width":500,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"<u>Warning:</u>\nFloating node \"course\" not found","type":"text"}],"edges":[{"id":"ee78fed8d9346629","fromNode":"7473cc1c6c72e117","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"e206a944b2d106de","toSide":"top"},{"id":"fd2b8178cae19237","fromNode":"e206a944b2d106de","fromSide":"left","toNode":"6b08fd22e19786b1","toSide":"right"},{"id":"374a870ee96c6553","fromNode":"6b08fd22e19786b1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"93f974dc493a92